        "answer": {
          "short": "$240x^4$",
          "worked": "$$T_r=\\binom{6}{r}2^rx^r$$\nFor $x^4$, let $r=4$.\n$$\\begin{align*}T_4&=\\binom{6}{4}2^4x^4\\\\T_4&=240x^4\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
